%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 043bf15b2a6a41c48971e11c678f419c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 472199573504
    m_Localized: We've been eaten. From now on, just focus on surviving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334352332992512
    m_Localized: From now on, a tile matching your color will randomly light up on
      the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334425666203648
    m_Localized: You have to step onto it before time runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334428463804416
    m_Localized: If you don't make it... the teeth on the ceiling will start falling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708864
    m_Localized: "This game has a Cheer System. \nIf your teammates cheer for you,
      you'll get a buff."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708865
    m_Localized: "There are two ways to cheer: \ntype /cheer Berry in chat, or say
      the Cheer Name with your voice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708866
    m_Localized: "In multiplayer, all teammates (except you) must cheer for you to
      activate the buff. \nIn solo, cheer for yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708867
    m_Localized: "Stealth is available. \nPress [Ctrl] to switch between Black and
      White. \nMatch the floor color to avoid detection by enemies and some traps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335177390338048
    m_Localized: Press <b><color=#FFC400>Space</color></b> when your color appears
      on the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335182629023744
    m_Localized: Anyone can press for white, but never press for black!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335185439207424
    m_Localized: A wrong press costs you time, so be careful!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335887280484352
    m_Localized: Get onto your color's tile and hold your ground!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335890795311104
    m_Localized: This is the last stretch of the mouth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335893903290368
    m_Localized: If we just hold on a little longer, we might get out...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337052009345024
    m_Localized: It's gone quiet in here... did it all stop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337056501444608
    m_Localized: Does that mean we can escape now...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337060553142272
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337068631371776
    m_Localized: Oh no, we're being swallowed...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337070598500352
    m_Localized: Did we just pass into the esophagus...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337897539088384
    m_Localized: Something feels like it's rolling in from behind...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337902496755712
    m_Localized: Run!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904153505792
    m_Localized: One wrong step and it's instant death. Just memorize the glowing
      tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904874926080
    m_Localized: It'll show by color this time. Make sure you match your own color!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337905520848896
    m_Localized: Even if the color's right, black-and-white will kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906154188800
    m_Localized: Each zone has a color in charge. The path only becomes safe once
      that color goes through first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906812694528
    m_Localized: Catch the fleeing red blood cells!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337907517337600
    m_Localized: Run from the antibodies and survive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339357207212032
    m_Localized: We've reached the end of the esophagus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339360646541312
    m_Localized: Maybe because it's the last stretch... the pressure feels different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339362018078720
    m_Localized: Don't stop, keep moving!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340094578438144
    m_Localized: The squeezing stopped. Phew... we actually made it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340096402960384
    m_Localized: But something's off with the floor...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340097782886400
    m_Localized: It's starting to collapse!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
